      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I wanted to also express my support. I've had some ideas for software I want to make and I feel like having VRC authentication would help. \n\nI do recognize that there are risks involved and that creating a system to manage this authentication method from VRC's end would take time and careful development. But I think the benefits from it are significant. \n\nI also think Discord is a pretty good reference for creating an authentication system.",
